THE LEVERAGE ECONOMY

Positioning

THE LEVERAGE ECONOMY is a high-density business and systems-thinking book designed for the modern solo operator. It explores how individuals can use AI, systems, leverage, and digital assets to produce results that previously required large teams and traditional infrastructure.

This is not a motivational book about working harder.
It is a structural blueprint for building scalable output through intelligent systems.

